rning more about what you have in mind.               </p>                <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px; color:#50545e; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;\">                 To help us understand your goals and make our conversation more valuable,                 you can request a consultation using the link below.               </p>                <!-- CTA button -->               <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 26px;\">                 <tr>                   <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#c9a96e\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\">                     <a href=\"https://tally.so/r/VpjZka\"                        target=\"_blank\"                        style=\"display:inline-block; padding:16px 24px; color:#111318; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">                       REQUEST A CONSULTATION &nbsp; &#8594;                     </a>                   </td>                 </tr>               </table>                <p style=\"margin:0 0 28px; color:#777b84; font-size:13px; line-height:1.7;\">                 No pressure, no complicated process — just an opportunity to tell us                 what you need and explore the next steps together.               </p>                <!-- Divider -->               <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">                 <tr>                   <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e9e9ec; font-size:1px; line-height:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>                 </tr>               </table>             </td>           </tr>            <!-- Sign-off -->           <tr>             <td style=\"padding:8px 36px 36px;\">               <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px; color:#50545e; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7;\">                 We look forward to hearing from you.               </p>               <p style=\"margin:0; color:#20232a; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; font-weight:bold;\">                 Warm regards,               </p>               <p style=\"margin:3px 0 0; color:#20232a; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold;\">                 The Rex DesignsHQ Team               </p>             </td>           </tr>            <!-- Footer -->           <tr>             <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#f8f8f9; padding:22px 28px;\">               <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px; color:#858894; font-size:11px; line-height:1.7;\">                 A thoughtful experience starts with a great conversation.               </p>               <p style=\"margin:0; color:#a0a2aa; font-size:10px; line-height:1.6;\">                 This email was sent because you submitted an enquiry to YOUR BUSINESS NAME.               </p>             </td>           </tr>          </table>        </td>     </tr>   </table>  </body> </html>",
